    "detailed_description": "With a nice visual mix of cel shading and stylized.<br>A Package For Space is a survival game with a unique concept: you will face not only the environment and deadly abominations but also time.<br>Can you escape and flee to the stars before it's too late?<br>A real race against time begins, your priorities will determine your success or failure.<br>Explore the environment and the remains of civilization to find materials and resources to build your own shelter and contribute to your survival.<br>At first you will have to find all kinds of food and drinks to survive day after day, but think about your own food, it is much less dangerous.<br>You will have to equip yourself and find or make a weapon to face the multiple dangers of this devastated world with dynamic weather.<br>Sometimes only a shelter can save you.<br>You will fight for your life, but in the end, only flight can save you.<br>Will you make the right decisions? Will you manage to escape or find a still possible solution to confront evil?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wherever you go, you will have to survive or die...</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "With a nice visual mix of cel shading and stylized.<br>A Package For Space is a survival game with a unique concept: you will face not only the environment and deadly abominations but also time.<br>Can you escape and flee to the stars before it's too late?<br>A real race against time begins, your priorities will determine your success or failure.<br>Explore the environment and the remains of civilization to find materials and resources to build your own shelter and contribute to your survival.<br>At first you will have to find all kinds of food and drinks to survive day after day, but think about your own food, it is much less dangerous.<br>You will have to equip yourself and find or make a weapon to face the multiple dangers of this devastated world with dynamic weather.<br>Sometimes only a shelter can save you.<br>You will fight for your life, but in the end, only flight can save you.<br>Will you make the right decisions? Will you manage to escape or find a still possible solution to confront evil?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wherever you go, you will have to survive or die...</h2>",
    "short_description": "A real race against time, your priorities will be the key to success..",
